### ====== TASKO API TESTS (IntelliJ HTTP Client) ======
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@ownerId = 1
@studentId = 2
@student2Id = 3

### 0) Health (optional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 1) My projects (owner=1) —
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/my
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

### 2) Create project (owner=1) — з відповіді автоматично збережемо joinCode та projectId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "name": "Demo Project",
  "description": "for tasks tests",
  "deadline": "2026-02-01"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("joinCode", response.body.joinCode);
    client.global.set("projectId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3) My projects after create (owner=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/my
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

### 4) Enrolled projects before join (student=2) — має бути []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

### 5) Join by code (student=2) — ВАЖЛИВО: використовуємо {{joinCode}}, не вставляємо руками
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

{
  "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}"
}

### 6) Enrolled projects after join (student=2) — має містити проєкт
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

### 7) Join same project again (student=2) — має бути ok (idempotent), без дубля
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

{
  "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}"
}

### 8) Enrolled projects after double join (student=2) — все ще 1 запис
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

### 9) Join with wrong code (student=2) — має бути 404/400, але не 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

{
  "joinCode": "WRONG123"
}

### 10) Enrolled projects before join (student=3) — має бути []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled
X-USER-ID: {{student2Id}}

### 11) Join by code (student=3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{student2Id}}

{
  "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}"
}

### 12) Enrolled projects after join (student=3) — має містити проєкт
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/enrolled
X-USER-ID: {{student2Id}}

### 13) Owner tries to join own project by code — має бути ok і без дубля
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}"
}



### 14) List tasks (owner=1) — спочатку []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

### 15) Create task (owner=1) — збережемо taskId з відповіді
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "title": "Task 1",
  "description": "First task",
  "deadline": "2026-02-10",
  "maxScore": 100
}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id);
%}

### 16) Create task без title (owner=1) — має впасти (краще 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "title": "   ",
  "description": "no title",
  "deadline": "2026-02-10",
  "maxScore": 100
}

### 17) List tasks (student=2) — має бачити задачі (бо учасник)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

### 18) Get task by id (student=2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

### 19) Update task (owner=1) — змінити title/description/deadline/maxScore
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "title": "Task 1 (updated)",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "deadline": "2026-02-15",
  "maxScore": 80
}

### 20) Update тільки maxScore (owner=1) — якщо дозволяєш partial update через null
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "maxScore": 60
}

### 21) Update status (owner=1) — TODO/IN_PROGRESS/DONE (як у твоєму enum)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 22) Update status як student=2 — має впасти (бо тільки OWNER)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### 23) Delete task (owner=1) — має бути 200/204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

### 24) Get deleted task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}

### 25) List tasks після delete — має бути []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
X-USER-ID: {{ownerId}}



### 26) List tasks неучасником (userId=999) — має впасти
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
X-USER-ID: 999

### 27) Create task студентом (userId=2) — має впасти (Only OWNER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-USER-ID: {{studentId}}

{
  "title": "Student tries create",
  "description": "should fail",
  "deadline": "2026-02-10",
  "maxScore": 10
}
